flowchart LR
  U[Operator and departmental reviewer] --> UI[Browser console: JavaScript and Leaflet]
  UI <-->|JSON and SSE| API[FastAPI routers and optional write login]
  API <--> DB[(SQLite: evidence and workflow)]
  API --> Q[In-process scheduler: bounded workers and per-site queue]
  Q --> MON[Monitoring orchestration]
  MON <--> CH[Provider chain: Earth Search then Planetary Computer then configured CDSE]
  CH <--> CACHE[(Cropped band and SCL cache)]
  MON --> GEO[Common 10 m UTM grid and cloud masks]
  GEO --> ML[Siamese change and land-cover U-Net or labelled spectral fallbacks]
  ML --> RULE[Regions, cause rules and same-season test]
  CTX[Rainfall, disaster feeds, OSM and terrain] --> RULE
  DB -->|In-force authorised zones| RULE
  RULE -->|Cases, findings and reasons| DB
  RULE --> AL[Alert eligibility, duplicate merging and department routing]
  AL --> DB
  AL --> DIS[In-app dispatch and optional SMTP]
  DIS --> OUT[(Saved unsent email or SMTP outcome)]
  DIS --> DB
  API --> PDF[Case investigation PDF]
  PDF --> U
  REG[Model registry and measured reports] --> API
